WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.599 --> 00:00:02.854
Tester: Step two, the keyboard on its own.

2
00:00:02.854 --> 00:00:07.430
Tester: No screen reader and no mouse, just the keys a keyboard user presses,

3
00:00:07.430 --> 00:00:10.150
Tester: and the focus ring that shows where I am.

4
00:00:10.791 --> 00:00:12.618
Keyboard: Tab → link, Skip to content

5
00:00:12.618 --> 00:00:14.444
Tester: The first stop is a skip link.

6
00:00:14.444 --> 00:00:18.768
Tester: I'll press Return, then Tab, to see whether it really skips the header.

7
00:00:19.378 --> 00:00:21.457
Keyboard: Return → main

8
00:00:21.457 --> 00:00:23.281
Keyboard: Tab → link, Read the writing

9
00:00:23.281 --> 00:00:27.481
Tester: I'm on Read the writing, past the whole header. The skip link works.

10
00:00:27.883 --> 00:00:30.489
Reviewer: That's WCAG 2.4.1, Bypass Blocks.

11
00:00:30.489 --> 00:00:36.883
Reviewer: Without it, a keyboard user tabs through every link in the header, on every page.

12
00:00:37.285 --> 00:00:39.361
Tester: Now back up, with Shift-Tab.

13
00:00:39.993 --> 00:00:42.050
Keyboard: Shift-Tab → button, Pause motion

14
00:00:42.050 --> 00:00:43.865
Keyboard: Shift-Tab → button, Set for you, collapsed

15
00:00:43.865 --> 00:00:47.968
Tester: Pause motion, then Set for you: the same order as on screen,

16
00:00:47.968 --> 00:00:50.565
Tester: and the focus ring follows every time.

17
00:00:50.966 --> 00:00:53.259
Reviewer: That's 2.4.7, Focus Visible.

18
00:00:53.259 --> 00:00:58.416
Reviewer: If you can't see where focus is, using a keyboard is guesswork.

19
00:00:58.817 --> 00:01:00.892
Tester: I'll open it with Return.

20
00:01:01.527 --> 00:01:03.568
Keyboard: Return → button, Set for you, expanded

21
00:01:03.568 --> 00:01:05.367
Keyboard: Tab → pop-up button, Drawings, in calm color

22
00:01:05.367 --> 00:01:09.358
Tester: It opens, and Tab takes me to the first setting, the drawings.

23
00:01:09.358 --> 00:01:14.767
Tester: With a dropdown focused, I can type the first letter of a choice. N, for not at all.

24
00:01:15.381 --> 00:01:17.782
Keyboard: Typed n

25
00:01:17.782 --> 00:01:19.282
Keyboard: Focus is on → pop-up button, Drawings, not at all

26
00:01:18.751 --> 00:01:23.026
Tester: The dropdown says not at all, and the drawings are gone. Now Escape.

27
00:01:23.647 --> 00:01:25.452
Keyboard: Escape → button, Set for you, collapsed

28
00:01:25.452 --> 00:01:30.977
Tester: Escape closes the panel, and puts focus back on the button. Next, Pause motion.

29
00:01:31.598 --> 00:01:33.682
Keyboard: Tab → button, Pause motion

30
00:01:33.682 --> 00:01:35.182
Keyboard: Space → button, Pause motion, pressed

31
00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:38.010
Tester: Space presses it, and the button now says pressed.

32
00:01:38.412 --> 00:01:42.723
Reviewer: Tab, Shift-Tab, Return, Escape, Space, and typing to choose.

33
00:01:42.723 --> 00:01:47.897
Reviewer: Every control works without a mouse, and focus is never trapped or lost.

34
00:01:47.897 --> 00:01:53.862
Reviewer: For what was tested, the goal of step two is met. WCAG 2.1.1, Keyboard, holds here.
